right why is there anyone special you had in mind yeah like maybe Oscar Junior or

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:25.700
someone like that you must be out of your mind what would I want with that big dopey conceited

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.000
jerk hey who are you calling conceited you think you're some great detective but you can't

